{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game is in <strong>early development</strong>, please stay tuned! If you like this game, add it to your wishlist ^0^</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Farm by the Black Hole!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a farming simulation featuring crop cultivation, animal husbandry, exploration, and interactions with NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most unique feature?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your home planet orbits near a supermassive black hole</strong>!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, venturing closer to the black hole triggers [gravitational time dilation], leading to surreal effects:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend 1 hour exploring near the black hole, and 5 hours will have passed back home!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return from the black hole to find freshly sown crops already ripe for harvest!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay too long near the black hole, and you might come back to a world utterly changed\u2014familiar faces and places gone forever.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951470/extras/7a870df71268bbe2931eef21b1f0338c.avif?t=1766420507\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploring near a black hole!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover other planets near the black hole, but never get too close! Gather rare resources and encounter strange wonders on alien worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951470/extras/a05626909cc7ec85426fad060da9301d.avif?t=1766420507\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cultivate Crops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, water, and reap bountiful harvests to sell for profit! If growth feels slow, take a trip near the black hole\u2014return to find your crops grown in a whoosh!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951470/extras/9eedaa8a9a941f6408c28c9976471ed9.avif?t=1766420507\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raise Animals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for chickens, dogs, and more by feeding them daily\u2014hungry animals won\u2019t thrive! They\u2019ll repay your kindness: hens lay eggs, dogs assist with chores... every creature rewards your devotion!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951470?t=1766420507","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951470/c7217541073a14f7d0dfd2b277b0867780a7b4ed/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766420507","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951470/c8074aaf5c4a9b74c36fff227b61206bdd0eb0e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766420507","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951470/c8074aaf5c4a9b74c36fff227b61206bdd0eb0e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766420507","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game is in <strong>early development</strong>, please stay tuned! If you like this game, add it to your wishlist ^0^</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Farm by the Black Hole!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a farming simulation featuring crop cultivation, animal husbandry, exploration,